{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b9f1c2a0-7e4d-4a11-9f2c-saberpro09",
    "name": "SaberPro Microservices",
    "description": "Colección del Taller 09 - Banco de Preguntas Saber PRO.\n\nComunicación síncrona (REST) y asíncrona (RabbitMQ).\n\nCarpetas por microservicio: User (:8081), Validation (:8082), Question (:8083), Lifecycle (:8084), Review (:8085), Notification (:8086).\n\nRequisitos para las operaciones asíncronas:\n- Levantar RabbitMQ:  docker compose up -d\n- Levantar los 6 servicios.\n- Las consultas posteriores (GET /operations/{id}, GET /lifecycle/{id}, GET /notifications) usan reintentos acotados; en el Collection Runner funciona sin configuración extra.\n\nLos ids y el operationId se guardan en variables de colección.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "user_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "validation_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8082" },
    { "key": "question_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8083" },
    { "key": "lifecycle_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8084" },
    { "key": "review_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8085" },
    { "key": "notification_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8086" },
    { "key": "questionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "operationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "operationId2", "value": "" },
    { "key": "e2eQuestionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "e2eOperationId", "value": "" }
